#: ../../source/api/advanced/bloom_filter.rst:5
#: 285c64cb1b314d7d9dd21f48f1332b84
msgid "Bloom Filter"
msgstr "Filtre de Bloom"

#: deb7cdcf43ff4425ad37873ae42f0fc3 of sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter:1
msgid "Bases: :py:class:`~sds.advanced.interfaces.AbstractProbabilisticSet`"
msgstr "Bases : :py:class:`~sds.advanced.interfaces.AbstractProbabilisticSet`"

#: 081819a262464428a62f569641e23c3c of sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter:1
msgid "Space-efficient probabilistic set membership structure."
msgstr "Structure probabiliste compacte de test d'appartenance à un ensemble."

#: 1a084d3567504fecb3aca87355377654 of sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter:3
msgid ""
"A Bloom filter uses k independent hash functions and a bit array of m "
"bits to represent a set. Adding an element sets k bits; querying checks "
"if all k bits are set."
msgstr "Un filtre de Bloom utilise k fonctions de hachage indépendantes et un tableau de m bits pour représenter un ensemble. L'ajout d'un élément positionne k bits ; le test vérifie que tous les k bits sont à 1."

#: d23a2b630ff843c49ca157ed65a8312c of sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter:7
msgid ""
"**No false negatives**: if ``item in bf`` returns False, the item is "
"definitely not in the set."
msgstr "**Aucun faux négatif** : si ``item in bf`` retourne False, l'élément est définitivement absent de l'ensemble."

#: 2f13f0430a7044ee8e647e39af694421 of sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter:9
msgid ""
"**Possible false positives**: if ``item in bf`` returns True, the item is"
" *probably* (but not certainly) in the set."
msgstr "**Faux positifs possibles** : si ``item in bf`` retourne True, l'élément est *probablement* (mais pas certainement) dans l'ensemble."

