#: 10965f265bff4400a9676a696dde237f of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:3
msgid ""
"Given the expected number of elements ``n`` and a target false positive "
"rate ``fp_rate``, returns the minimal bit array size ``m`` and the "
"optimal number of hash functions ``k``."
msgstr "Étant donné le nombre attendu d'éléments ``n`` et un taux de faux positifs cible ``fp_rate``, retourne la taille minimale du tableau de bits ``m`` et le nombre optimal de fonctions de hachage ``k``."

#: 622a470867af4f32bf84d2b78e67c360 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:7
msgid "Expected number of elements to insert. Must be positive."
msgstr "Nombre attendu d'éléments à insérer. Doit être positif."

#: 834807d56b2b45b8a7652c8435870348 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:9
msgid "Target false positive probability. Must be in (0.0, 1.0)."
msgstr "Probabilité de faux positifs cible. Doit être dans (0.0, 1.0)."

#: d47d1c47bd6041e08eb65551a25caa12 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:12
msgid ""
"A ``(size, num_hashes)`` pair where ``size`` is the bit array length and "
"``num_hashes`` is the number of hash functions."
msgstr "Un couple ``(size, num_hashes)`` où ``size`` est la longueur du tableau de bits et ``num_hashes`` est le nombre de fonctions de hachage."

#: 5e54e8203e4e459783d8a7f5d5f983b3 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:16
msgid "If ``n`` is not positive or ``fp_rate`` is not in (0, 1)."
msgstr "Si ``n`` n'est pas positif ou si ``fp_rate`` n'est pas dans (0, 1)."

#: bdba407965e04bd19aab040e56929b4b of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:28
msgid "Formulae used:"
msgstr "Formules utilisées :"

#: 36a70fcbb1dc4ee1aa50037081eb3138 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:30
msgid ""
"m = \\lceil -n \\cdot \\ln(p) / (\\ln 2)^2 \\rceil\n"
"\n"
"k = \\lfloor (m / n) \\cdot \\ln(2) \\rfloor"
msgstr "m = \\lceil -n \\cdot \\ln(p) / (\\ln 2)^2 \\rceil\n\nk = \\lfloor (m / n) \\cdot \\ln(2) \\rfloor"

#: c2657e1af7b3419fa3aa83197ca9dfd9 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.optimal_params:36
msgid "where :math:`p` is ``fp_rate`` and :math:`m` is rounded up."
msgstr "où :math:`p` désigne ``fp_rate`` et :math:`m` est arrondi vers le haut."

#: b7688c0e69cf41f5b6310b52691e5dee of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.add:1
msgid "Add an item to the Bloom filter."
msgstr "Ajoute un élément au filtre de Bloom."

#: a7f861dcc80d482c92cd8ac121ee1ba8 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.add:3
msgid ""
"Sets the k bits corresponding to the item's hash positions. After calling"
" ``add(item)``, ``item in self`` will always return True."
msgstr "Positionne les k bits correspondant aux positions de hachage de l'élément. Après l'appel de ``add(item)``, ``item in self`` retourne toujours True."

#: e9516609305a4ea0bf7eae3f4b745b54 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.add:6
msgid "Item to add. Must be convertible to a string."
msgstr "Élément à ajouter. Doit être convertible en chaîne."

#: f836fa2a51ed4724ad8f2ebd713f807b of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.add:18
msgid "Time complexity: O(k) where k is ``num_hashes``."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(k) où k est ``num_hashes``."

#: 10f591fbe2724795b48ccd01c1410b59 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__contains__:1
msgid "Test if an item might be in the set."
msgstr "Teste si un élément est susceptible d'être dans l'ensemble."

#: 7fa6c48448cc4b41a65a2611252978e5 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__contains__:3
msgid ""
"Returns False if the item is **definitely** not in the set (no false "
"negatives). Returns True if the item is **probably** in the set (false "
"positives are possible)."
msgstr "Retourne False si l'élément est **définitivement** absent de l'ensemble (aucun faux négatif). Retourne True si l'élément est **probablement** dans l'ensemble (les faux positifs sont possibles)."

#: d019d36926b94e67a5509ded34457b80 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__contains__:7
msgid "Item to test. Must be convertible to a string."
msgstr "Élément à tester. Doit être convertible en chaîne."

#: 54d64cad145d4af0912bbaece509087f of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__contains__:10
msgid ""
"True if all k bit positions are set (probable member). False if any bit "
"position is unset (definite non-member)."
msgstr "True si toutes les k positions de bits sont à 1 (membre probable). False si au moins une position de bit est à 0 (non-membre certain)."

#: 8ac5d433022e4a5bbd2d90c583920d22 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__contains__:25
msgid "Time complexity: O(k)."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(k)."

#: 7366a2576a9e4eb1ad201f514e1e41dd of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fill_ratio:1
msgid "Return the proportion of bits set to 1 in the bit array."
msgstr "Retourne la proportion de bits positionnés à 1 dans le tableau de bits."

#: 48d9ee287dd6492a822d559ee9ed1978 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fill_ratio:3
msgid ""
"A fill ratio near 0.5 corresponds to the optimal false positive rate for "
"a well-configured filter. As the ratio approaches 1.0, the false positive"
" rate rises sharply."
msgstr "Un taux de remplissage proche de 0.5 correspond au taux de faux positifs optimal pour un filtre bien configuré. Lorsque ce taux approche 1.0, le taux de faux positifs augmente rapidement."

#: 3d615537faa8488abb4477d8c5748528 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fill_ratio:7
msgid "Fraction of bits set (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "Fraction de bits positionnés à 1 (0.0 à 1.0)."

#: bd94a32cf6cd49919089c110f131375b of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fill_ratio:21
msgid "Time complexity: O(m/8) — iterates over the byte array."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(m/8) — itère sur le tableau d'octets."

#: 7e0bbd09632a41f79ccd204f5290f8fa of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fp_rate:1
msgid "Estimate the current false positive probability."
msgstr "Estime la probabilité courante de faux positifs."

#: b574f1c5ebf14a72a13f70464f6c0789 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fp_rate:3
msgid "Uses the fill ratio to approximate the false positive rate:"
msgstr "Utilise le taux de remplissage pour approximer le taux de faux positifs :"

#: 2b2a385b6a7845a2b6e8b1d458f05f3c of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fp_rate:5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "P(fp) \\approx \\text{fill\\_ratio}^k"
msgstr "P(fp) \\approx \\text{fill\\_ratio}^k"

#: 0295f8bce9a94a618d624624b6f1c0e7 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fp_rate:9
msgid "Estimated false positive probability (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "Probabilité de faux positifs estimée (0.0 à 1.0)."

#: ce2fab4183b84c0286cf6e124350f4f0 f07653b6d88f4e6488601ad70527c9ec of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.estimated_fp_rate:20
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:29
msgid "Time complexity: O(m/8)."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(m/8)."

#: 507fe8bf9607471e86005a5746c85a84 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:1
msgid "Return a new Bloom filter representing the union of two filters."
msgstr "Retourne un nouveau filtre de Bloom représentant l'union de deux filtres."

#: 337e27d334a240a4a1b77cd3fcaadba8 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:3
msgid ""
"The union filter will return True for any item that either source filter "
"would return True for. Both filters must have identical ``size`` and "
"``num_hashes``."
msgstr "Le filtre union retournera True pour tout élément que l'un ou l'autre des filtres sources retournerait True. Les deux filtres doivent avoir des ``size`` et ``num_hashes`` identiques."

#: 21f0cfc57d8247a4b826e523f039bbb8 928b33a43362465cb6d99febc15f5cbe of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:7
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:7
msgid "Another Bloom filter with the same ``size`` and ``num_hashes``."
msgstr "Un autre filtre de Bloom avec les mêmes ``size`` et ``num_hashes``."

#: 354a261993dc4aaa8d07606a94ee0871 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:10
msgid "A new filter whose bit array is the bitwise OR of both arrays."
msgstr "Un nouveau filtre dont le tableau de bits est le OU bit à bit des deux tableaux."

#: d549a3010edc4bb38d248fe966c11cfc e8698ae8a5484cafad9948212b6cedf7 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:13
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.union:13
msgid "If the two filters have different ``size`` or ``num_hashes``."
msgstr "Si les deux filtres ont des ``size`` ou ``num_hashes`` différents."

#: 574fe3f41df4496aa09af4b48fa881a7 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:1
msgid "Return a new filter representing an approximate intersection."
msgstr "Retourne un nouveau filtre représentant une intersection approximative."

#: c311849293b848e0871afc4bbe9e2028 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:3
msgid ""
"The result is an *over-approximation*: it may include false positives for"
" items in neither filter, because the bit arrays are ORed over time. Both"
" filters must have identical ``size`` and ``num_hashes``."
msgstr "Le résultat est une *sur-approximation* : il peut inclure des faux positifs pour des éléments absents des deux filtres, car les tableaux de bits s'accumulent au fil du temps. Les deux filtres doivent avoir des ``size`` et ``num_hashes`` identiques."

#: 3ac75e36d4844adc8a2ca86decbff895 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:10
msgid "A new filter whose bit array is the bitwise AND of both arrays."
msgstr "Un nouveau filtre dont le tableau de bits est le ET bit à bit des deux tableaux."

#: 96c04e1aae6e467d85dc40733db5fc7c of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.intersection:29
msgid ""
"Time complexity: O(m/8). The intersection filter has a higher false "
"positive rate than the individual filters. Use with caution."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(m/8). Le filtre intersection a un taux de faux positifs plus élevé que les filtres individuels. À utiliser avec précaution."

#: e5415ae7ed7344d8a4d24f03baca4950 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.is_empty:1
msgid "Return True if no items have been added."
msgstr "Retourne True si aucun élément n'a été ajouté."

#: 386ab883595b4c469b52793f69c89bcf of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.is_empty:3
msgid "True if count is 0."
msgstr "True si le compteur est à 0."

#: 323189c342a1469480c8b86f083c6078 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.is_empty:8
msgid "Time complexity: O(1)."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(1)."

#: 555e6a0ae2e5464eaec7e2120fa2d7b7 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.clear:1
msgid "Reset the filter to its initial empty state."
msgstr "Réinitialise le filtre à son état vide initial."

#: 352fd3eb160548e480990a7b625e6523 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.clear:3
msgid "Clears the bit array and resets the item count."
msgstr "Efface le tableau de bits et remet le compteur à zéro."

#: 491a80ba91394860a9c5dbeed84aa746 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.clear:7
msgid "Time complexity: O(m/8) — resets the byte array."
msgstr "Complexité temporelle : O(m/8) — réinitialise le tableau d'octets."

#: 4686161fc4984bb18db8d8488e39a2f9 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__iter__:1
msgid "Not supported — Bloom filters do not store elements."
msgstr "Non pris en charge — les filtres de Bloom ne stockent pas les éléments."

#: 1e5b5d42b82944beb68eac8216312133 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__iter__:3
msgid "Always, because elements cannot be recovered from a Bloom filter."
msgstr "Toujours, car les éléments ne peuvent pas être récupérés depuis un filtre de Bloom."

#: 2c6f83a898044bb39052d94184ae09d6 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__len__:1
msgid "Return the number of items added."
msgstr "Retourne le nombre d'éléments ajoutés."

#: 8cc72c59876649a79e2698be70ea4c34 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__len__:3
msgid "Value of :attr:`count`."
msgstr "Valeur de :attr:`count`."

#: be7851269ddc4180ae1c13a1214c49c5 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__repr__:1
msgid "Return a detailed string representation."
msgstr "Retourne une représentation textuelle détaillée."

#: 94af2153c99942deb271e58d09af32e1 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__repr__:3
msgid "String of the form ``BloomFilter(size=m, num_hashes=k, count=n)``."
msgstr "Chaîne de la forme ``BloomFilter(size=m, num_hashes=k, count=n)``."

#: 897c01f248de40bc9b1a98e7b755d837 of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__str__:1
msgid "Return a concise string representation."
msgstr "Retourne une représentation textuelle concise."

#: d3213347fabd46c69cfd50b7f9f8340b of
#: sds.advanced.bloom_filter.BloomFilter.__str__:3
msgid "Human-readable summary of the filter state."
msgstr "Résumé lisible de l'état du filtre."

